<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Complexe problemen, oftewel ‘wicked</span><span style="margin: 0px"> problems</span><span style="margin: 0px">’, hebben een aantal kenmerken:</span>&nbsp;</span></p><ol style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Complexiteit</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">: </span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">wicked</span> </span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">problems</span> bestaan uit meerdere onderling verbonden delen en subsystemen. De complexiteit verwijst naar de vele elementen en hun onderlinge afhankelijkheid binnen een probleem.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Onzekerheid</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">: dit aspect omvat onduidelijkheden over risico's, de gevolgen van acties en de veranderingen die optreden in de omstandigheden of beschikbare middelen na verloop van tijd.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Waardeverschil</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">: er spelen verschillende belangen, perspectieven en waarden bij de betrokken stakeholders. Dit verschil kan leiden tot uiteenlopende opvattingen over wat belangrijk is en over de aanpak van problemen.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ol><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><br></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Schematische visualisatie van een wicked</span><span style="margin: 0px"> problem</span><span style="margin: 0px"> (Veltman et al., 2021)&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Bij het ontwerpen van transdisciplinair</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> onderwijs is het van belang dat het complexe probleem voldoet aan deze kenmerken.&nbsp; Tegelijkertijd moet het vraagstuk ook ‘leerbaar’ zijn; met </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">leerbaar </span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">bedoelen we dat het vraagstuk zodanig moet zijn ingericht dat deelnemers ervan kunnen leren.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 8px 0px 4px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Een goed geformuleerd vraagstuk biedt studenten ruimte om te verkennen, onderzoeken maar geeft ook richting.&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66)">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 8px 0px 4px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Door vraagstukken zorgvuldig te formuleren, ontstaat een leeromgeving waarin studenten actief bijdragen aan maatschappelijke verandering én hun eigen leerproces verdiepen.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66)">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 8px 0px 4px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66)">&nbsp;</span></p><table aria-rowcount="5" data-clean-table="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: windowtext !important" lang="NL-NL">Leerbaarheidsaspect</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: windowtext !important" lang="NL-NL">Reflectievragen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">1. Concreet probleem met zicht op oorzaken</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Wat is het probleem? Wat speelt er onder de oppervlakte?&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">2. Specifieke context</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Waar speelt dit? Wat is kenmerkend aan deze plek of organisatie?&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">3. Meerdere belanghebbenden</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Wie zijn betrokken? Welke belangen of perspectieven botsen?&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">4. Richting zonder vast antwoord</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Welke oplossingsrichting is zinvol om te verkennen, zonder al een oplossing te formuleren?&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Bronnen:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Veltman, M. E., Van Keulen, J., &amp; Voogt, J. M. (2021). Using problems</span><span style="margin: 0px"> with</span><span style="margin: 0px"> wicked</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tendencies</span><span style="margin: 0px"> as vehicles</span><span style="margin: 0px"> for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in higher</span><span style="margin: 0px"> professional education</span><span style="margin: 0px">: Towards</span><span style="margin: 0px"> coherent curriculum design. The Curriculum Journal, 32(3), 559-583.</span>&nbsp;</span></p></body>
</html>